<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Insperity Invoice"  relatedToType="Account" recipientType="Contact">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
<p>Perhaps you missed an invoice?</p>
<p>Your attention is needed in resolving the past due status of the attached invoice. Per the terms of your agreement with Insperity invoices are due net 30.
If you would like to pay by credit card, please use the link below to access our online payment portal or contact us directly.</p>
<c:NSP_dunningInvoicesList caseId="{!relatedTo.Id}" caseAccId="{!relatedTo.Id}"> </c:NSP_dunningInvoicesList>  
<p>Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.</p>
<c:NSP_InsperityEmailLogo ></c:NSP_InsperityEmailLogo>
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>